RHSA-2012-1462.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/51309","http://secunia.com/advisories/53372","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201308-06.xml","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:150","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpujul2012-392727.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/54551","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027263","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/77061","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2012/CVE-2012-0540.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/74a17114d313d1fcf11590910ec4d27e95394ac2/2012/CVE-2012-0540.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0540.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-0540.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2012/CVE-2012-0540.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0540","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0540.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-0540","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/003e8cad66924d61c3369093ab10818154ac5271/CVEs/2012/CVE-2012-0540.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-0540.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0067.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0015","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-4032","title":"WebsitePanel 登录页面开放重定向漏洞","description":"WebsitePanel（Windows 服务器管理面板）登录页面 Default.aspx 存在开放重定向漏洞。攻击者可通过在 ReturnUrl 参数中构造恶意 URL，诱使用户点击后跳转到任意外部网站，进而实施钓鱼攻击。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的 ReturnUrl 参数进行充分验证，影响 WebsitePanel 1.2.2.1 之前的所有版本。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 5.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-4032"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-07-17T21:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:44:18Z","remediation":"升级 WebsitePanel 至 1.2.2.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ReturnUrl 参数未校验跳转目标的问题。如无法升级，在反向代理或 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 层面对 Default.aspx 的 ReturnUrl 参数实施白名单校验，仅允许跳转到本站域名内地址。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/83689","http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/114541/WebsitePanel-CMS-Open-Redirect.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49813","http://websitepanel.codeplex.com/workitem/224","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/54346","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/76803","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37488","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4032.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2012/CVE-2012-4032.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/0c7acbe01d12e3db33eedacb7a2c97c0d518fac0/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4032.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2012/4xxx/CVE-2012-4032.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-4032","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2012-4032_1.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2012-4032.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2012-4032_6.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2012-4032_2.yaml","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/8916c231213b31bc2afad1cbbe3753ce4d817960/api/2012/CVE-2012-4032.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/pocs/blob/9aacbdfa8e3d43186bb2335e317c74fdeb4a88a9/data_single/2012/CVE-2012-4032.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0256","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0256.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2843","title":"Google Chrome 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 20.0.1132.57 之前版本中的 WebKit 组件存在释放后使用漏洞，该漏洞源于布局高度跟踪过程中对已释放内存的引用。远程攻击者可构造特制网页，诱使用户访问，触发释放后使用，导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务，或可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Chrome 及使用 WebKit 的 Apple Safari 等产品，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Google 已在 Chrome 20.0.1132.57 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2843"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-12T21:55:06Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:42:12Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 20.0.1132.57 或更高版本（2012 年 7 月稳定版更新已修复此漏洞）。Apple Safari 用户应升级至 6.0.1 或更高版本（参考 HT5485/HT5502）。openSUSE 用户安装 2012 年 8 月安全更新。由于该漏洞可通过 WebKit 影响其他嵌入应用，建议统一更新系统 WebKit 库至修复版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=130595","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/07/stable-channel-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00005.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-08/msg00009.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5502","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15569","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2012/CVE-2012-2843.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2843.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7