E-2012-0255.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0109","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1854","title":"Microsoft Visual Basic for Applications 不安全库加载权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Visual Basic for Applications (VBA) 的 VBE6.dll 组件存在不可信搜索路径漏洞（CWE-426）。当用户通过 Microsoft Office 2003 SP3、2007 SP2/SP3、2010 Gold/SP1 等受影响版本打开包含恶意 DLL 文件的目录中的 .docx 文档时，VBE6.dll 会优先从当前工作目录而非系统路径加载库文件。本地攻击者可将特制木马 DLL 放置在包含 Office 文档的目录中，诱使用户打开该文档即可触发 DLL 劫持，从而在用户权限上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞在 2012 年 7 月已被野外利用，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1854"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-07-10T21:55:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:25Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS12-046 提供的更新：Office 2003 SP3 安装 KB2687626，Office 2007 SP2/SP3 安装 KB2596744，Office 2010/SP1 安装 KB2598243 和 KB2553447，VBA 运行时安装 KB2688865。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 下载中心手动安装。临时缓解措施：禁用 WebClient 服务，在防火墙层面阻止 TCP 139/445 端口，或使用 KB2264107 工具禁用从远程网络共享加载库。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-192A.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2012/ms12-046","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14950","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/SecurityBulletins/2012/ms12-046","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-1854","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1854.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1854","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1854.json","https://github.com/elementalsouls/Claude-BugHunter/blob/4b6c6a525169df4cc5b3353257393ffd7b57e455/docs/cve-coverage.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_