a527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-2824","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-2824.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-2824","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-2824.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2012-2824.yml","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-2824","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c6e457224984003aac7610b750677033fb679879/tracker/CVE/2012/CVE-2012-2824.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0252.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0251","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0251.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2818","title":"Google Chrome CSS计数器布局释放后重用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 在 20.0.1132.43 之前版本存在 use-after-free（释放后重用）内存错误引用漏洞。当浏览器渲染使用了 CSS 计数器（Cascading Style Sheets counters）特性的文档时，由于对计数器布局的处理不当，可能在已释放的内存区域执行引用操作，导致内存损坏。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问包含特制 CSS 计数器的恶意网页来触发该漏洞，造成浏览器崩溃（拒绝服务）或在特定条件下实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 Chrome 的用户，攻击条件简单，仅需用户访问恶意网页即可触发。Google 已在 Chrome 20.0.1132.43 版本中修复此问题，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2818"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-27T10:18:38Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:42:09Z","remediation":"建议将 Google Chrome 升级至 20.0.1132.43 或更高版本以修复此漏洞，可通过 Chrome 菜单\"关于 Google Chrome\"自动检测并安装更新。如无法立即升级，可临时避免访问使用 CSS counters 特性的未知网页，并禁用 Chrome 的 JavaScript 执行功能作为缓解措施，直至完成版本升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=120944","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/06/sta