:"CVE-2012-2817","title":"Google Chrome 节表释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 20.0.1132.43 之前版本中存在释放后使用（Use-after-free）漏洞，该漏洞源于对包含节（sections）的 HTML 表格对象处理不当，在内存对象被释放后未正确清除指针。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制网页，触发浏览器对已释放内存的访问，导致拒绝服务或可能执行任意代码。攻击无需身份认证，仅需用户正常浏览网页即可触发，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2817"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-27T10:18:38Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:42:09Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 20.0.1132.43 或更高版本，该版本已修复表节处理中的释放后重用漏洞。使用 Apple Safari 的用户应升级至 Safari 6.0.1（OS X Lion）或 Safari 5.1.7（OS X Snow Leopard），对应 Apple 安全公告 HT5485 和 HT5502。基于 WebKit 的第三方应用应同步更新至修复后的 WebKit 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=120222","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/06/stable-channel-update_26.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00005.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5502","https://hermes.opensuse.org/messages/15075728","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15264","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2817.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2012/CVE-2012-2817.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2817","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-2817","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/fe242ff8f9bd06fa5992f95d5f72ac31b4b3a661/data/anchore/2012/CVE-2012-2817.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-2817","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-2817.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-2817","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-2817.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2012-2817.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0250.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0249","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0249.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2815","title":"Google Chrome 跨域信息泄露漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 20.0.1132.43之前版本中存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造包含跨域IFRAME元素的恶意网页，利用不同域名下iframe元素对URL片段标识符（fragment identifier）的访问权限，获取目标页面中的敏感信息。该漏洞无需用户认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，仅影响机密性。Google已在Chrome 20.0.1132.43版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2815"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-27T10:18:38Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:42:09Z","remediation":"将 Google Chrome 升级至 20.0.1132.43 或更高版本；Apple Safari 用户升级至 6.0 或更高版本；Apple iOS 用户升级至 6.0 或更高版本。Linux 发行版用户通过包管理器更新 chromium 浏览器。无法立即升级时，可在浏览器中禁用 JavaScript 或使用 NoScript 类扩展阻止跨域 IFRAME 访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=118633","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/06/stable-channel-update_26.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://hermes.opensuse.org/messages/15075728","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15662","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2815.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2012/CVE-2012-2815.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2815","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-2815","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/fe242ff8f9bd06fa5992f95d5f72ac31b4b3a661/data/anchore/2012/CVE-2012-2815.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-2815","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-2815.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/13c625dd1a5e44f0d75be1e975abf7d18b111552/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-2815","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-2815.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2012-2815.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0249.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0012","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2122","title":"Oracle MySQL 身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"MySQL 和 MariaDB 在特定环境下存在身份认证绕过漏洞。该漏洞源于 sql/password.c 中密码令牌比较函数的返回值检查不完善，当运行在某些特定 memcmp 函数实现的系统上时，memcmp 可能因字节比较的整数溢出而返回非预期结果（零值）。远程攻击者无需知道正确密码，只需在登录过程中反复使用同一错误密码进行认证尝试，即可在约 256 次尝试内使令牌比较意外成功，从而绕过身份验证机制，获取数据库的完全访问权限，实现数据的未授权读取、修改或删除。该漏洞影响 MySQL 5.1.63 之前版本、5.5.24 之前版本、5.6.6 之前版本，以及 MariaDB 5.1.62/5.2.12/5.3.6/5.5.23 之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.1，危害等级中危。Oracle 和 MariaDB 官方已在后续版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2122"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-26T18:55:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:41:02Z","remediation":"升级 MySQL 至 5.1.63、5.5.24 或 5.6.6 及以上版本，MariaDB 升级至 5.1.62、5.2.12、5.3.6 或 5.5.23 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在应用层增加登录失败次数限制和延迟策略，降低暴力重试认证的成功率。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.mysql.com/bug.php?id=64884","http://kb.askmonty.org/en/mariadb-5162-release-notes/","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-08/msg00007.html","http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2012/q2/493","http://secunia.com/advisories/49417","http://secunia.com/advisories/53372","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201308-06.xml","http://securitytracker.com/id?1027143","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19092","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53911","https://community.rapid7.com/community/metasploit/blog/2012/06/11/cve-2012-2122-a-tragically-comedic-security-flaw-in-mysql","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19092","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/javascript/cves/2012/CVE-2012-2122.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2012/CVE-2012-2122.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/1a583c77a151b9c5f4534bb6fe376ed9456e38c3/2012/CVE-2012-2122.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/数据库漏洞/MySQL 身份认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2012-2122.md","https://github.com/lal0ne/vulnerability/blob/5b9f397c1970203b1764fb7a66a0ffac39bef4cc/MySQL/CVE-2012-2122/CVE-2012-2122.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/mysql/CVE-2012-2122.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/60da8fc5d75736d782765eb922eb4d5875f1de92/data/by-cve/CVE-2012-2122.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-2122.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2012/CVE-2012-2122/vultarget/README.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/60da8fc5d75736d782765eb922eb4d5875f1de92/data/2012/CVE-2012-212